{"id":386,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"独立自営と表現力を育む森村学園","feature_description":"森村学園は「独立自営」を建学の精神とし、自ら学び考え、行動する力を育てています。中等部の国語科では、読む・書く・話す・聞く力を関連づけ、言葉を通して考えを深め、表現する学習に取り組みます。文章の論理構成や語彙を学び、ディベートやプレゼンテーションを重ねることで、筋道を立てて伝える力を伸ばします。学びの成果を発表し、他者に伝える経験を積み重ねます。","clubs":[{"id":7214,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7215,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7216,"name":"ゴルフ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7217,"name":"管弦楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7218,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7219,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7220,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13857,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13858,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13859,"name":"新体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13860,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13861,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.morimura.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13862,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.mor